# Patch 'curated-shanks' (triples ADDED in their place). Hand-written, not generated.
# Shanks is the captain of the Red Hair Pirates, but upstream only lists Chief / Emperor / Apprentice, so "Pirate" and "captain" questions said no.
# op:Pirate_Captain makes him a CaptainCharacter and (property chain in extension.ttl) a Pirate.
@prefix op: <http://kalnassag.com/onepiece#> .

op:Shanks op:occupation op:Pirate_Captain .
